# Page header (`ModulePage` / `PageHeader`)

## Layout

- **Left:** optional module **`icon`** — bordered orb (`h-10 w-10`, `rounded-card`, muted fill). **Required on every `ModulePage` and `CrudMainView` list page.** Use `*PageIcon()` from `@/lib/modulePageIcons` or re-export in module `shared.tsx` — `size={20} weight="duotone"`, same icon as sidebar nav when applicable.
- **Left:** `backTo` → `<BackButton>` (icon only, `aria-label="Back"`) — after module icon when both present.
- **Left:** `title` + `subtitle` (meta + status tags live in `subtitle`).
- **Top-right (`actions`):** Real actions only — never read-only state.

```tsx
// users/shared.tsx re-exports usersPageIcon from @/lib/modulePageIcons
<CrudMainView title="Users" icon={usersPageIcon()} … />
<ModulePage title={user.name} icon={userRecordPageIcon()} backTo="/users" … />
```

## `actions` slot

| Allowed | Not allowed |
|---------|-------------|
| `PageHeaderCtaLink` / `PageHeaderCtaButton` — “New X” on list pages | Raw `<Button variant="cta">` without `PageHeaderButtons` |
| `PageHeaderExportButton` — icon-only Export first (via `CrudMainView`) | Labeled Export text in header |
| `PageHeaderOutlineLink` — secondary (e.g. Board view) | `StatusBadge`, stage/priority `Badge`, or any status chip |
| `<IconEditButton>` / `<IconDeleteButton>` on **detail** pages | Visible “Edit” / “Delete” text on header buttons |
| Export, filter, other operational buttons | Duplicating status already shown in `subtitle` |

## Button sizing (header row)

All header buttons use **`size="sm"` (h-7)**. Export is **icon-only** (`PageHeaderExportButton`, tooltip). Never use `default`/`lg` in `actions`.

## Action order (left → right)

1. **Export** (icon, when `exportOptions` on `CrudMainView`)
2. **Secondary** (e.g. Board view) inside `headerActions`
3. **CTA last** (e.g. `PageHeaderCtaLink` “New case”)

```tsx
// cases/shared.tsx — secondary then CTA; CrudMainView prepends Export
<>
  <PageHeaderOutlineLink to="/cases/board">Board view</PageHeaderOutlineLink>
  <PageHeaderCtaLink to="/cases/new">…</PageHeaderCtaLink>
</>
```

## Status & tags

Put `StatusBadge` and semantic tags (priority, stage, type) in **`subtitle`**, inline with meta (client name, SKU, case title). Example:

```tsx
subtitle={
  <span className="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
    <span>{clientName}</span>
    <StatusBadge status={status} variantMap={STATUS_MAP} />
  </span>
}
```

## Edit / Delete

Always icon-only in the page header:

```tsx
import { IconEditButton, IconDeleteButton } from '@/components/common/RecordIconButtons';

actions={
  <div className="flex items-center gap-2">
    <IconEditButton to={`/clients/${id}/edit`} />
    <IconDeleteButton onClick={() => setConfirmDeleteOpen(true)} />
  </div>
}
```

- `size="icon"`, `variant="outline"`, required `aria-label`.
- Do not add visible “Edit” / “Delete” strings next to the icon.
- Dropdown menu items and confirm dialogs may still use text labels.
